Implementation:

```dart
/// Lexical path spelling used by the cwd == home guard: duplicate
/// slashes collapse (`$HOME` with a trailing slash composes
/// `/home//.fah/config.yaml`), so spelling variants of the same file
/// compare equal. Lexical only — no `dart:io`, symlink resolution
/// stays the host's job.
static String _normalizePath(String path) {
  return path.replaceAll(RegExp('//+'), '/');
